{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方大字号粉色标题“心里又热了起来”，随后自然扫到下方橙红色“有了劲头”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"内心重新被点燃，恢复了向前行动的劲头。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心里发热、振奋、重新燃起热情。\",\n  \"missed\": \"小字中的心跳被推向最高处、快速八度明亮地向前冲，以及最后高音和弦可以理解为一个决定或从梦中醒来的具体含义；右上角的全曲阶段目录也不容易完整读到。\",\n  \"burden\": [],\n  \"score\": 4\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ba78fc5d-c454-4b5b-981a-3c9ecc4d5260", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T023547787016Z", "elapsed_seconds": 18.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:36:06.220981+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "86684a83b01d95cd642c89b7beeac3755d24832670269d4ab21134bad1aed135", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "